{"id":"ad0895bc76f1713f","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-beck-chevalley.md","title":"Theorem — 依赖和与依赖积的 Beck–Chevalley 比较","display":"Theorem — 依赖和与依赖积的 Beck–Chevalley 比较","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-beck-chevalley","aliases":["14-thm-beck-chevalley"],"display":"Theorem — 依赖和与依赖积的 Beck–Chevalley 比较","depends_on":["[[14-df-slice-category]]","[[14-df-base-change-dependent-sum]]","[[14-df-dependent-product]]","[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","[[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]"],"source_ref":"Independent pullback-and-adjunction consequence of I.9 Theorem 4, pp.59–61, and IV.7 Theorem 2, pp.192–193; DjVu images 35–36,102","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-beck-chevalley"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-beck-chevalley</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 依赖和与依赖积的 Beck–Chevalley 比较"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7cd6386b14d5d667\" href=\"?note=7cd6386b14d5d667\" title=\"14-df-slice-category\">14-df-slice-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"269866ac001274e3\" href=\"?note=269866ac001274e3\" title=\"14-df-base-change-dependent-sum\">14-df-base-change-dependent-sum</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c57bdb000eaf6b30\" href=\"?note=c57bdb000eaf6b30\" title=\"14-df-dependent-product\">14-df-dependent-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"199dc3cf97e92fa1\" href=\"?note=199dc3cf97e92fa1\" title=\"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers\">14-df-pullbacks-equalizers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"637a464575207be3\" href=\"?note=637a464575207be3\" title=\"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor\">14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Independent pullback-and-adjunction consequence of I.9 Theorem 4, pp.59–61, and IV.7 Theorem 2, pp.192–193; DjVu images 35–36,102"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A\\to B\">\\(f:A\\to B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:B&#39;\\to B\">\\(h:B&#39;\\to B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A&#39;,g,f&#39;)\">\\((A&#39;,g,f&#39;)\\)</span> 是它们的拉回，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:A&#39;\\to A\">\\(g:A&#39;\\to A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;:A&#39;\\to B&#39;\">\\(f&#39;:A&#39;\\to B&#39;\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fg=hf&#39;\">\\(fg=hf&#39;\\)</span>。所有切片函子见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"269866ac001274e3\" href=\"?note=269866ac001274e3\" title=\"14-df-base-change-dependent-sum\">14-df-base-change-dependent-sum</a>–<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c57bdb000eaf6b30\" href=\"?note=c57bdb000eaf6b30\" title=\"14-df-dependent-product\">14-df-dependent-product</a>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\in\\mathcal E/B\">\\(Z\\in\\mathcal E/B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_Z:f&#39;^*h^*Z\\xrightarrow{\\sim}g^*f^*Z\">\\(c_Z:f&#39;^*h^*Z\\xrightarrow{\\sim}g^*f^*Z\\)</span> 为两次拉回的典范比较：其底层箭头是唯一保持到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 的投影的箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_P:f^*\\Pi_fP\\to P\">\\(\\varepsilon_P:f^*\\Pi_fP\\to P\\)</span> 是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c57bdb000eaf6b30\" href=\"?note=c57bdb000eaf6b30\" title=\"14-df-dependent-product\">14-df-dependent-product</a>的余单位。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(X,p:X\\to A)\">\\(P=(X,p:X\\to A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_P=h^*\\Sigma_fP\">\\(L_P=h^*\\Sigma_fP\\)</span> 的底层拉回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 有投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l_{B&#39;}:L\\to B&#39;\">\\(l_{B&#39;}:L\\to B&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l_X:L\\to X\">\\(l_X:L\\to X\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g^*P\">\\(g^*P\\)</span> 的底层拉回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 有投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_{A&#39;}:R\\to A&#39;\">\\(r_{A&#39;}:R\\to A&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_X:R\\to X\">\\(r_X:R\\to X\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle-,-\\rangle_{f,h}\">\\(\\langle-,-\\rangle_{f,h}\\)</span> 是到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\)</span> 的拉回配对，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle-,-\\rangle_{g,p}\">\\(\\langle-,-\\rangle_{g,p}\\)</span> 是到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的拉回配对。下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi^{f&#39;}\">\\(\\Phi^{f&#39;}\\)</span> 是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c57bdb000eaf6b30\" href=\"?note=c57bdb000eaf6b30\" title=\"14-df-dependent-product\">14-df-dependent-product</a>中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;^*\\dashv\\Pi_{f&#39;}\">\\(f&#39;^*\\dashv\\Pi_{f&#39;}\\)</span> 的转置双射。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_Z\">\\(x_Z\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_Z\">\\(y_Z\\)</span> 分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;^*h^*Z\">\\(f&#39;^*h^*Z\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g^*f^*Z\">\\(g^*f^*Z\\)</span> 的底层对象沿两次拉回到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 底层对象的投影复合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_{A&#39;}\">\\(b_{A&#39;}\\)</span> 见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"7cd6386b14d5d667\" href=\"?note=7cd6386b14d5d667\" title=\"14-df-slice-category\">14-df-slice-category</a>。自然变换三元组采用<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\alpha_P)_P\">\\((\\alpha_P)_P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\beta_P)_P\">\\((\\beta_P)_P\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E/A)\">\\(P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E/A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\exists!c\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E/A&#39;}(f&#39;{}^*h^*Z,g^*f^*Z)\\quad y_Z\\circ b_{A&#39;}(c)=x_Z,\\\\\nc_Z:=\\iota c\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E/A&#39;}(f&#39;^*h^*Z,g^*f^*Z)\\ (y_Z\\circ b_{A&#39;}(c)=x_Z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsIso}(c_Z),\\\\\n\\alpha_P:=\\left(L_P,\\Sigma_{f&#39;}g^*P,\\left\\langle\\langle p\\circ l_X,l_{B&#39;}\\rangle_{f,h},l_X\\right\\rangle_{g,p}\\right),\\\\\n\\alpha_P^{-1}:=\\left(\\Sigma_{f&#39;}g^*P,L_P,\\langle f&#39;\\circ r_{A&#39;},r_X\\rangle_{h,f\\circ p}\\right),\\\\\n\\beta_P:=\\Phi^{f&#39;}_{h^*\\Pi_fP,g^*P}\\left(g^*(\\varepsilon_P)\\circ c_{\\Pi_fP}\\right),\\\\\n\\alpha:=(h^*\\circ\\Sigma_f,\\Sigma_{f&#39;}\\circ g^*,(\\alpha_P)_P),\\qquad\n\\beta:=(h^*\\circ\\Pi_f,\\Pi_{f&#39;}\\circ g^*,(\\beta_P)_P),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsNaturalIso}(\\alpha,h^*\\circ\\Sigma_f,\\Sigma_{f&#39;}\\circ g^*),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsNaturalIso}(\\beta,h^*\\circ\\Pi_f,\\Pi_{f&#39;}\\circ g^*),\\\\\n\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E/A)\\quad\\operatorname{IsIso}(\\alpha_P)\\land\\operatorname{IsIso}(\\beta_P).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\exists!c\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E/A&#39;}(f&#39;{}^*h^*Z,g^*f^*Z)\\quad y_Z\\circ b_{A&#39;}(c)=x_Z,\\\\\nc_Z:=\\iota c\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E/A&#39;}(f&#39;^*h^*Z,g^*f^*Z)\\ (y_Z\\circ b_{A&#39;}(c)=x_Z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsIso}(c_Z),\\\\\n\\alpha_P:=\\left(L_P,\\Sigma_{f&#39;}g^*P,\\left\\langle\\langle p\\circ l_X,l_{B&#39;}\\rangle_{f,h},l_X\\right\\rangle_{g,p}\\right),\\\\\n\\alpha_P^{-1}:=\\left(\\Sigma_{f&#39;}g^*P,L_P,\\langle f&#39;\\circ r_{A&#39;},r_X\\rangle_{h,f\\circ p}\\right),\\\\\n\\beta_P:=\\Phi^{f&#39;}_{h^*\\Pi_fP,g^*P}\\left(g^*(\\varepsilon_P)\\circ c_{\\Pi_fP}\\right),\\\\\n\\alpha:=(h^*\\circ\\Sigma_f,\\Sigma_{f&#39;}\\circ g^*,(\\alpha_P)_P),\\qquad\n\\beta:=(h^*\\circ\\Pi_f,\\Pi_{f&#39;}\\circ g^*,(\\beta_P)_P),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsNaturalIso}(\\alpha,h^*\\circ\\Sigma_f,\\Sigma_{f&#39;}\\circ g^*),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsNaturalIso}(\\beta,h^*\\circ\\Pi_f,\\Pi_{f&#39;}\\circ g^*),\\\\\n\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E/A)\\quad\\operatorname{IsIso}(\\alpha_P)\\land\\operatorname{IsIso}(\\beta_P).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>这是据本次已读的原书 I.9 与 IV.7 的拉回、伴随构造推出的比较定理，原书这些页未以本标题单列此一般方块；来源字段明确区分原文与推导。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 的两个底层函数都由拉回配对给出，逐投影计算其两复合为恒等，故为自然同构。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\in\\mathcal E/B&#39;\">\\(Z\\in\\mathcal E/B&#39;\\)</span>，先将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{/B&#39;}(Z,h^*\\Pi_fP)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{/B&#39;}(Z,h^*\\Pi_fP)\\)</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_h\\dashv h^*\">\\(\\Sigma_h\\dashv h^*\\)</span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{/B}(\\Sigma_hZ,\\Pi_fP)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{/B}(\\Sigma_hZ,\\Pi_fP)\\)</span>，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^*\\dashv\\Pi_f\">\\(f^*\\dashv\\Pi_f\\)</span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{/A}(f^*\\Sigma_hZ,P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{/A}(f^*\\Sigma_hZ,P)\\)</span>。由拉回方块的同一配对计算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^*\\Sigma_hZ\\cong\\Sigma_g f&#39;^*Z\">\\(f^*\\Sigma_hZ\\cong\\Sigma_g f&#39;^*Z\\)</span>。两次伴随将此 Hom 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{/B&#39;}(Z,\\Pi_{f&#39;}g^*P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{/B&#39;}(Z,\\Pi_{f&#39;}g^*P)\\)</span>。这些双射对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z,P\">\\(Z,P\\)</span> 自然，故 Yoneda 给自然同构；把恒等代入并按单位、余单位展开，其分量正是所写的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_P\">\\(\\beta_P\\)</span>。因此证明的是这个典范 mate 可逆，而非仅抽象存在某个对象同构。</p>\n<p>未把选定拉回之间的比较当作严格等号；非拉回的交换方块仍可写转置比较，但上面的同构结论不应无条件沿用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-slice-category","status":"resolved","id":"7cd6386b14d5d667","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-slice-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-base-change-dependent-sum","status":"resolved","id":"269866ac001274e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-base-change-dependent-sum]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-dependent-product","status":"resolved","id":"c57bdb000eaf6b30","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-dependent-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers","status":"resolved","id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor","status":"resolved","id":"637a464575207be3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-base-change-dependent-sum","status":"resolved","id":"269866ac001274e3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，$f:A\\to B$、$h:B'\\to B$；$(A',g,f')$ 是它们的拉回，$g:A'\\to A$、$f':A'\\to B'$，$fg=hf'$。所有切片函子见[[14-df-base-change-dependent-sum]]–[[14-df-dependent-product]]。对 $Z\\in\\mathcal E/B$，$c_Z:f'^*h^*Z\\xrightarrow{\\sim}g^*f^*Z$ 为两次拉回的典范比较：其底层箭头是唯一保持到 $A'$ 和 $Z$ 的投影的箭头。$\\varepsilon_P:f^*\\Pi_fP\\to P$ 是[[14-df-dependent-product]]的余单位。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-dependent-product","status":"resolved","id":"c57bdb000eaf6b30","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，$f:A\\to B$、$h:B'\\to B$；$(A',g,f')$ 是它们的拉回，$g:A'\\to A$、$f':A'\\to B'$，$fg=hf'$。所有切片函子见[[14-df-base-change-dependent-sum]]–[[14-df-dependent-product]]。对 $Z\\in\\mathcal E/B$，$c_Z:f'^*h^*Z\\xrightarrow{\\sim}g^*f^*Z$ 为两次拉回的典范比较：其底层箭头是唯一保持到 $A'$ 和 $Z$ 的投影的箭头。$\\varepsilon_P:f^*\\Pi_fP\\to P$ 是[[14-df-dependent-product]]的余单位。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-dependent-product","status":"resolved","id":"c57bdb000eaf6b30","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，$f:A\\to B$、$h:B'\\to B$；$(A',g,f')$ 是它们的拉回，$g:A'\\to A$、$f':A'\\to B'$，$fg=hf'$。所有切片函子见[[14-df-base-change-dependent-sum]]–[[14-df-dependent-product]]。对 $Z\\in\\mathcal E/B$，$c_Z:f'^*h^*Z\\xrightarrow{\\sim}g^*f^*Z$ 为两次拉回的典范比较：其底层箭头是唯一保持到 $A'$ 和 $Z$ 的投影的箭头。$\\varepsilon_P:f^*\\Pi_fP\\to P$ 是[[14-df-dependent-product]]的余单位。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-dependent-product","status":"resolved","id":"c57bdb000eaf6b30","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P=(X,p:X\\to A)$；$L_P=h^*\\Sigma_fP$ 的底层拉回 $L$ 有投影 $l_{B'}:L\\to B'$、$l_X:L\\to X$。$g^*P$ 的底层拉回 $R$ 有投影 $r_{A'}:R\\to A'$、$r_X:R\\to X$。$\\langle-,-\\rangle_{f,h}$ 是到 $A'$ 的拉回配对，$\\langle-,-\\rangle_{g,p}$ 是到 $R$ 的拉回配对。下式的 $\\Phi^{f'}$ 是[[14-df-dependent-product]]中 $f'^*\\dashv\\Pi_{f'}$ 的转置双射。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-slice-category","status":"resolved","id":"7cd6386b14d5d667","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x_Z$、$y_Z$ 分别是 $f'^*h^*Z$、$g^*f^*Z$ 的底层对象沿两次拉回到 $Z$ 底层对象的投影复合；$b_{A'}$ 见[[14-df-slice-category]]。自然变换三元组采用[[14-df-natural-transformation]]；$(\\alpha_P)_P$、$(\\beta_P)_P$ 遍历 $P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E/A)$。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x_Z$、$y_Z$ 分别是 $f'^*h^*Z$、$g^*f^*Z$ 的底层对象沿两次拉回到 $Z$ 底层对象的投影复合；$b_{A'}$ 见[[14-df-slice-category]]。自然变换三元组采用[[14-df-natural-transformation]]；$(\\alpha_P)_P$、$(\\beta_P)_P$ 遍历 $P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E/A)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"f:A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"h:B'\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"(A',g,f')","display":false},{"tex":"g:A'\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"f':A'\\to B'","display":false},{"tex":"fg=hf'","display":false},{"tex":"Z\\in\\mathcal E/B","display":false},{"tex":"c_Z:f'^*h^*Z\\xrightarrow{\\sim}g^*f^*Z","display":false},{"tex":"A'","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":f